<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<PLUGIN name="header-fix" author="EllipticSet" version="2026.11.06.1800" pluginURL="https://raw.githubusercontent.com/EllipticSet/unraid-header-fix/main/plugin/header-fix.plg" support="https://github.com/EllipticSet/unraid-header-fix/issues" min="7.1.0" icon="header-fix.png">
  <CHANGES>
###2026.11.06.1800
- Fit the header and pages to the screen on phones with the Unraid 7.1 to 7.3 header. The server name box was wider than the screen, so iOS Safari zoomed out and left an empty strip on the right.

###2026.11.06.1700
- Make the UNRAID logo tappable on phones with the Unraid 7.1 to 7.3 header, where the server name box covered it. Custom CSS is no longer needed for this.

###2026.10.26.1900
- Show the plugin icon from the repository on the Plugins page and in Community Applications, instead of the generic wrench.

###2026.10.25.1800
- The plugin file now contains the package, so installation and updates no longer download it from GitHub.
- Add Community Applications metadata for the EllipticSet fork.

###2026.10.24.1600
- Fix the logo link on Unraid 7.4.0-rc.2, whose header does not use the uh-logo class.
- Rewrite only the unraid.net home link in the header logo; other unraid.net links are left unchanged.

###2026.10.24.0000
- Support the unified Unraid 7.4 header, including the placeholder shown before it loads.
- The plugin is now maintained at https://github.com/EllipticSet/unraid-header-fix.

###2026.10.18.0000
- End of support for the original plugin by Derek Kaser.

###2026.03.19.2240
- Fix the name format on the Plugins page.

###2026.01.07.02
- Add a link to the support thread.
</CHANGES>
